   "text": "A striking new review for the Gabit Smart Ring! @bsindia   spent several weeks with the Gabit Smart Ring. \nThe verdict: a more useful health companion than expected, and one that fits into your routine without asking for attention.\n\nThe review highlights what we\u2019ve worked hard to get right: \nComfort. Battery life. Continuous tracking. Sleep. Women\u2019s health. Simplicity.\n\nHere\u2019s what stood out:\n\n\ud83c\udf19Sleep: Deep and REM sleep stages, sleep debt, and consistency, from a ring comfortable enough to actually sleep in.\n\ud83d\udd0bBattery: Exactly one week in testing, Wednesday to Wednesday.\n\ud83d\udccaAccuracy: Steps and heart rate were largely in line with other reliable devices.\n\ud83d\udca7Durability: 5ATM water resistance held up through showers and swims.\n\ud83d\udc8dDesign: Titanium, under 4g, and mistaken for a regular ring.\n\ud83c\udf38Women's Health: It\u2019s more than a period tracker, with a range of insights.\n\ud83e\udd57AI Voice Food Logging: simply say what you ate to log it to get calories and macros.\n\nFull review: https://t.co/lUyNkluWO6\n\n#Gabit #GabitSmartRing #HealthTech #Wearables #ProductReview",
