   "text": "Here are the latest products added to the VoiceAISpace Library:\n\nAto AI - Screen-free AI companion designed to keep seniors connected with families.\n\nplotweaverapp  - Unified voice AI platform transforming content into multilingual audio experiences.\n\ntelavox  - White-label conversational operating system for telecom operators and service providers.\n\nPatter - Open-source SDK connecting voice AI agents to real phone calls.\n\nVoibe  - Fast, private voice dictation application for Mac and Windows computers.\n\nBoldVoice - Accent training app combining Hollywood coach lessons and AI feedback.\n\nSay It Labs - AI-powered, voice-activated video games for speech therapy and early literacy.\n\nSpark Ring - AI smart ring that instantly captures and organizes voice notes.\nRecombine AI - Self-hosted conversational AI platform for enterprise voice and text agents.\n\nLEXIA - Sovereign speech-to-text technology providing secure, enterprise-grade voice integration solutions.\n\nSpecker AI - AI English speaking coach named Stella that calls you daily.\nSee more cool Voice AI startups here\n\nSee all in by checking the link in the comments",
